&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenTable:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&lt;/p&gt;
