&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus on High-Value Activities:&lt;/strong&gt; Prioritize complex, high-impact technical work that moves the needle for Focus &amp;amp; Strategic customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster an environment where every Celonaut owns customer success while accelerating their own professional trajectory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
